2. The following offences may be compounded by any officer of the Agency authorised to do so under section 71 of the Act:
(a)any offence (other than a continuing offence) under section 47(2)(a), 48(3), 49(4), 51(2), 54(1), (2), (3) or (5), 55(1) or (2), 56(1) or (2), 57(1) or (2), 58 or 62(1) or (2) of the Act;
(b)any offence under regulation 10(2) of the Carbon Pricing (Measurement, Reporting and Verification) Regulations 2018.
